{"id":"68353af5ed159f6f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-bounding.md","title":"Bounding Set","display":"df-bounding — Bounding Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bounding","aliases":["58-df-bounding","Bounding Set"],"display":"df-bounding — Bounding Set","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bounding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bounding</span><span>Bounding Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounding — Bounding Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\subseteq P\">\\(B \\subseteq P\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b \\in P\">\\(b \\in P\\)</span> (candidate upper bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}\\)</span> (upper-bound predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}\\)</span> (bounded-above predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}\">\\(\\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}\\)</span> (least-upper-bound predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\in P\">\\(s \\in P\\)</span> (supremum candidate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land b\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;(x\\leq b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land b\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;(x\\leq b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}above} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}(B) \\leftrightarrow B\\subseteq P\\land\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}above} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}(B) \\leftrightarrow B\\subseteq P\\land\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding} \\vdash \\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}(B,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(s,B)\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;(\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)\\to s\\leq b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding} \\vdash \\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}(B,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(s,B)\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;(\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)\\to s\\leq b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bounding set: set having an upper (or lower) bound in partial order</li>\n<li>Metric boundedness is a different notion; in finite-dimensional normed spaces, boundedness is equivalent to relative compactness.</li>\n<li>A general poset need not supply a least upper bound for every bounded-above subset; that property is an additional completeness condition.</li>\n<li>Dedekind cuts: cuts by bounded sets with no supremum define reals</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Davey and Priestley, Introduction to Lattices and Order</li>\n<li>Royden, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"B \\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"b \\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"s \\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land b\\in P\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;(x\\leq b)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}above} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedAbove}_{P,\\leq}(B) \\leftrightarrow B\\subseteq P\\land\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounding} \\vdash \\mathrm{LUB}_{P,\\leq}(B,s) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(s,B)\\land\\forall b\\in P\\;(\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq}(b,B)\\to s\\leq b)","display":true}],"bytes":1822,"backlinks":[{"id":"1aff2ee432333e82","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-bounding.md]])"},{"id":"8ffdd76172ba4225","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"769a9261fce38a2d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\leq^*$ (eventual-domination relation, see [[58-df-bounding]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-bounding.md|58-df-bounding]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["83dfbde66bc78255"]}